Our solution, based on our Atelier platform, provides an intelligent assistance tool that supports staff in their daily activities, facilitating access to information, improving the quality of written outputs, and reducing processing and documentation times. The platform ensures data sovereignty, security, and compliance with regulatory requirements, including GDPR, HDS certification, and medical confidentiality.

We will integrate our solution with the existing hospital information system (SIH) and electronic patient record (DPI), supporting health interoperability standards such as HL7 and FHIR, and ensuring compatibility with the national framework (Ségur du numérique en santé, Mon espace santé/DMP). Our API-first design enables easy embedding in existing work environments.

To address the client's requirements for response time and availability, our solution provides a median latency of 1.3 seconds and common single-document queries are below 2 seconds at p95. We operate 24/7 on an appropriate hosting tier, targeting 99.9% availability. Our active-active setup across two availability zones ensures high availability and continuity of care.

