Our budget approach is based on a phased implementation, with one-off project costs estimated at €270,000 (30% of the total budget) and recurring run costs of €630,000 (70% of the total budget) over 5 years. We aim to maintain a gross margin percentage between 25% and 35%, ensuring compatibility with the authority's budgetary capacity.

Our team consists of experienced professionals, including a project director, solution architect, engineers, data scientist, and security compliance lead. We provide change management support and training resources to ensure a smooth transition for the client's staff.

In conclusion, our consortium offers a comprehensive solution that meets the client's requirements for an AI assistance tool, ensuring data sovereignty, security, and compliance with regulatory requirements. We are committed to delivering a high-quality solution that improves the efficiency and quality of care at CHRB, while minimizing environmental impact and maintaining a controlled annual operating cost.
